From 900c3c1b73ce1605ab9a080de98c3eb32381c8ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kai Huang <kai.huang@intel.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Jun 2024 23:46:41 +1200
Subject: [PATCH 027/164] KVM: TDX: Get TDX global information

KVM will need to consult some essential TDX global information to create
and run TDX guests.  Get the global information after initializing TDX.

Signed-off-by: Kai Huang <kai.huang@intel.com>
---
 arch/x86/kvm/vmx/tdx.c | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/x86/kvm/vmx/tdx.c b/arch/x86/kvm/vmx/tdx.c
index 8651599822d5..99f579329de9 100644
--- a/arch/x86/kvm/vmx/tdx.c
