---
Yan: rebased to tdx_kvm_dev-2024-06-21
---
 .../selftests/kvm/include/x86_64/tdx/tdx.h    |   5 +
 .../selftests/kvm/lib/x86_64/tdx/tdx.c        |  27 +++
